---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Editorial Policy"
  description="How Drawinging plans, writes, reviews, and updates drawing tutorials and worksheets."
  permalink="/editorial-policy/"
>
  <p>
    This editorial policy explains how Drawinging creates educational drawing content. It is designed to keep lessons
    useful, cannibalization-safe, and transparent.
  </p>
  <h2>Topic selection</h2>
  <p>
    Topics are chosen from keyword research, category balance, evergreen demand, and trademark safety. Character or
    brand subjects are held for review and are not auto-published.
  </p>
  <h2>Keyword ownership</h2>
  <p>
    Every tutorial owns exactly one primary focus keyword and exact-match permalink. Closely related variants such as
    “easy”, “simple”, and “step by step” are covered on the same page when intent overlaps.
  </p>
  <h2>Review process</h2>
  <p>
    Before publication, pages are checked for duplicate focus keywords, overlapping category intent, broken links,
    missing worksheets, and placeholder text. Validation scripts support this process.
  </p>
  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>
    Tutorials may be updated when steps improve, images are replaced, or internal links change. The updated date on each
    page reflects material revisions.
  </p>
  <h2>Image policy</h2>
  <p>
    We use original local assets and placeholders. We do not scrape competitor artwork or imply affiliation with
    trademarked characters.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
